    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The brightest light casts the darkest shadow - and from within this blackness, a rival power dwells. Shadow priests fully embrace this opposing polarity, their faith equally resolute as their holy counterparts. Like all priests, they dedicate much of their lives to worship - However, they dedicate it to Shadow magic and the void, setting themselves around the doctrines of decay and madness.</p><p>Shadow Calling Spells</p><table><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"58\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Priest Levels</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Spells</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"58\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">1st</p></td><td><p>Cause Fear, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.spells.Item.T3SBcFNt14IJ80xe]{Dark Void}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"58\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3rd</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.spells.Item.uHjhQucQy3YR2Wnk]{Mind Flay}, Phantasmal Force</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"58\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.spells.Item.vnqNnpiseO6hoZXf]{Void Shift}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.UfHQhA54M4323gVO]{Vampiric Touch}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"58\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">7th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.DGONTFbk5eORs5qv]{Black Tentacles}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.BYNvBJzHcF5VJhXw]{Phantasmal Killer}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"58\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">9th</p></td><td><p>Enervation, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.spells.Item.AwWfettICHPhTiGy]{Shadow Crash}</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
